  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">株式会社第四北越銀行</jpcrp_cor:NameOfGroupCompanyHoldingLargestAmountOfInvestmentSharesInGroup>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">取引先の資本政策への支援のため</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesOtherThanThoseNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">TSUBASAアライアンスの連携による共同出資会社設立のため</jpcrp_cor:ReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesSharesNotListedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">信越化学工業株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">取引関係の維持・強化のために保有しております。新潟県内に工場等を有する企業として、地域の産業振興や雇用創出に貢献しており、取引先の成長性・将来性、取引状況などの観点から総合的に保有の妥当性を確認しております。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">有</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">北越コーポレーション株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
